# No trailing slash: "node_modules/" matches only a directory, so a SYMLINK named
# node_modules (a self-link, committed in fc041d1e) slipped past it and broke
# every clone's `npm`/electron with "too many levels of symbolic links".
node_modules
dist/
# Vendored by bundle-runtime.sh: a whole CPython, its site-packages and a copy
# of the plugin tree -- ~95MB of BUILD OUTPUT, reproducible from the checkout
# plus a pinned download. Committing it would also put a second, silently
# divergent copy of the plugin in the repo.
payload/
__pycache__/
